{title: Standing in the Need of Prayer}
{artist: African American spiritual}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Chorus
It's [G]me, it's me, it's me, O Lord, [C]standing in the need of [G]prayer;
it's me, it's me, it's me, O Lord, [D]standing in the need of [G]prayer.

Verse 1
Not my [G]brother, not my sister, but it's [C]me, O [G]Lord, standing in the need of [D]prayer;
not my [G]brother, not my sister, but it's [C]me, O [G]Lord, [D]standing in the need of [G]prayer.
